--- frontend/src/commands/operations/paper/README.md ---
     1	# Paper Operations
     2	
     3	Operations modifying the rendering layer state.
     4	
     5	**Scope**: PaperJS primitives, rendering caches, element visibility, visual feedback.
     6	
     7	**Future Operations**:
     8	- `InvalidateCacheOp` - Invalidate Paper.js rendering cache
     9	- `SetVisibilityOp` - Show/hide element in rendering
    10	- `UpdateHighlightOp` - Change highlight state
    11	
    12	All Paper operations modify the presentation layer (canvas presentation renderer adapters) without affecting the domain model.
--- frontend/src/commands/operations/toolbar/README.md ---
     1	# Toolbar Operations
     2	
     3	Operations modifying UI control state.
     4	
     5	**Scope**: Active tool, tool options, tool feedback messages, UI state.
     6	
     7	**Future Operations**:
     8	- `SetActiveToolOp` - Change active tool (point, line, circle, etc.)
     9	- `SetToolFeedbackOp` - Update tool feedback text
    10	- `SetToolOptionsOp` - Update tool configuration
    11	
    12	All Toolbar operations modify UI state (toolStore) to make tool changes undoable.
